            "pages": {
              "end": 3,
              "start": 3
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The petitioner argues that semen stains on the victim\u2019s clothing matched him, but DNA evidence disproves this."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioner",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "3ed1f7875fa46e77cca277934dfe34b655b069bc75de861a94b8914adaad1730",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-3ed1f7875fa4-0000-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 4,
              "start": 4
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Petitioner, the petitioner asserts that bloodstains on his jeans matched the victim, yet the medical examiner testified the blood originated from an autopsy sample."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioner",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "3ed1f7875fa46e77cca277934dfe34b655b069bc75de861a94b8914adaad1730",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-3ed1f7875fa4-0000-0006"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 12,
              "start": 12
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Petitioner, a missing tube of blood led the petitioner to file a pre\u2011trial motion to suppress that evidence."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioner",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "3ed1f7875fa46e77cca277934dfe34b655b069bc75de861a94b8914adaad1730",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-3ed1f7875fa4-0000-0005"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 8,
              "start": 8
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The petitioner maintains that the case should be evaluated on whether any reasonable juror could have found him guilty."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioner",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "3ed1f7875fa46e77cca277934dfe34b655b069bc75de861a94b8914adaad1730",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-3ed1f7875fa4-0001-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 20,
              "start": 20
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Petitioner, mr. Kissinger indicated that a Brady claim regarding undisclosed evidence would be made."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Respondent",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "3ed1f7875fa46e77cca277934dfe34b655b069bc75de861a94b8914adaad1730",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-3ed1f7875fa4-0001-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 33,
              "start": 33
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The respondent (State of Tennessee) argues that the enzyme was present as testified by Agent\u202fBigbee."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "State of Tennessee",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "3ed1f7875fa46e77cca277934dfe34b655b069bc75de861a94b8914adaad1730",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-3ed1f7875fa4-0003-0006"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 58,
              "start": 58
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to State of Tennessee, the respondent states that the daughter heard no signs of a struggle near the murder scene."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Pathologist",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "3ed1f7875fa46e77cca277934dfe34b655b069bc75de861a94b8914adaad1730",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-3ed1f7875fa4-0003-0007"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 58,
              "start": 58
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The pathologist testified that scratches on the victim\u2019s thighs were more likely caused by dragging, not by assault."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "District Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "3ed1f7875fa46e77cca277934dfe34b655b069bc75de861a94b8914adaad1730",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-3ed1f7875fa4-0003-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 57,
              "start": 57
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The district court found the petitioner\u2019s testimony incredible and Lora\u202fMuncey\u2019s testimony credible."
      }
